s card and check out his website.  Thanks Chris and Mitch for 2 fantastic days!"}],"state":"CA"}", "original_answer": "Wine Tasting Designated Drivers of Santa Barbara is a local business located in Santa Barbara, CA. The business offers services in the food, limos, bars, wineries, tours, wine bars, arts & entertainment, breweries, hotels & travel, wine tours, transportation, taxis, and nightlife categories. They operate from 8:00 AM to 10:00 PM every day of the week.

